[PrintTextModified Text:第二天晚餐后——<br>我和诺亚来到了淋浴房。|#0201Adv19_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在标有囚犯编号的储物柜里，每天都放着一模一样的衣服。<br>我们每天只能穿这个。|#0201Adv19_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算已经使用好几次这个储物柜了，<br>每次看到还是会不由自主地因厌恶而咂舌。|#0201Adv19_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:把我们当换装娃娃吗……|#0201Adv19_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚讨厌洗澡。|#0201Adv19_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:我都帮你洗了，就别任性了。|#0201Adv19_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:每天都要洗吗？<br>三天洗一次不行吗？|#0201Adv19_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不行。每天都要洗。|#0201Adv19_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:小气鬼～|#0201Adv19_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是什么小气。这座监牢的卫生状况<br>本来就不太好。所以我们应当保持清洁……|#0201Adv19_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我刚一开始向诺亚啰啰嗦嗦地说教时，<br>手中的智能手机闪烁起来，提示有新的通知。|#0201Adv19_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:查看后发现，和之前预告的一样，<br>原来是泽渡可可开始了直播。|#0201Adv19_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:直播画面上显示着可可。<br>诺亚也凑过来看我的手机。|#0201Adv19_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,40 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL2
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,40 IdAndAppearance:Noah

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是可可。<br>她在哪里呢？？|#0201Adv19_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

